# BMad Method Configuration for Claude Code
# This file helps Claude Code agents follow the BMAD methodology.

# Personas
# analyst: adopt bmad-agent-analyst
# pm: adopt bmad-agent-pm
# architect: adopt bmad-agent-architect
# dev: adopt bmad-agent-dev
# ux: adopt bmad-agent-ux-designer
# writer: adopt bmad-agent-tech-writer

# Instructions
- Always check `.claude/skills` for BMad-specific tools.
- Refer to `_bmad/config.toml` for project-specific agent names and icons.
- Use the `_bmad-output` directory for all generated artifacts.
- Follow the BMad Method lifecycle: Analysis -> Planning -> Solutioning -> Implementation.
- adopt a persona explicitly when starting a task (e.g. "Adopting the Amelia persona to implement this feature").
